    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Inside out",
        "body": "$L(8) = 73$; $L(73) = 5329 + 9 = 5338$; $A(5338) = 16014 - 4 = 16010$; $F(16010) = 16012$.\n\n**Answer: 16,012**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Compose F and A first",
        "body": "$F(A(y)) = 3y - 4 + 2 = 3y - 2$. With $y = L(L(8)) = 73^2 + 9 = 5338$: $3(5338) - 2 = 16{,}012$.\n\n**Answer: 16,012**"
